  "description": "An ordinary office worker, Woo Shin, who believed in a romantic love story. All the lovers he had been dating, thinking it was a fateful connection, turned out to be duds. Just as he was trying to turn his focus away from destiny and seek stability, someone keeps appearing in his line of sight.\n\nOnce... Twice... And then, three times...?\n\nCould this meeting be a coincidence, or is it fate?\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/fatewemet)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nJapanese: [Beltoon](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/fatewemet), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.jp/comic/fatewemet)  \nOthers: [Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/fatewemet)",
